==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Professor A.]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[General GreGory]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
For General GreGory, use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] paired with Attack UP [[Cat Combo|Combos]] such as [[Cool Japan (Combo)|Cool Japan]] and/or with any powerful [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] that you may have. Finish him off with [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] where applicable.

For Professor A, Awakened Bahamut is unable to touch him without the [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt Cannon|Thunderbolt Cannon]], so do not bother sending him out during this phase unless you have Thunderbolt equipped. Instead, cycle through [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island Cats]] + [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cats]] and Maglev Cats to chip him down. Use any [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rusher]] Ubers that you may have.

For Lord Gravey, [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] Ubers such those from the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|IRON LEGION]] set are pretty much a must-have. You could cheese him using Awakened Bahamut and Sniper the Cat/[[Cat Cannon]], but the timing window is extremely tight. If one is lucky enough to have [[Sarukani (Uber Rare Cat)|The One-Hit Wonders]], the final phase will be a breeze especially when paired with Attack UP Combos.

